<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n28155" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">δουλ-εία</span></b> , ἡ, 
			Ion.
		
		<b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">δουλ-ηΐη</span></b> 
		<i><span class="en">
			Anacr.
			114
		</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
			Hdt.
			6.12
		</span></i>: also <b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">δουλία</span></b> 
		<i><span class="en">
			Pi.
			<u>P.</u>
			1.75
		</span></i>:—<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>slavery,
				bondage,</i> ll. cc., <i><span class="en">
				A.
				<u>Th.</u>
				253
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">δουλείας γάγγαμον, ζυγά,</span>
			<i><span class="en">
				Id.
				<u>Ag.</u>
				360
			</span></i>(anap.), <i><span class="en">
				S.
				<u>Aj.</u>
				944
			</span></i>(lyr.); 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">δ. καὶ ὑπηρεσία</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Ar.
					<u>V.</u>
					602
				</span></i>
			; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἡ τῶν κρεισσόνων δ.</span>
			<i>imposed by</i> them, <i><span class="en">
				Th.
				1.8
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἡ ὑπὸ τῶν βαρβάρων δ.</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Pl.
					<u>R.</u>
					469c
				</span></i>
			; applied to the condition of the subject allies of Athens,
				<i><span class="en">
				Th.
				5.9
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			collectively, <i>slaves,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">δουλεύοντα δουλείαις ἐμαῖς</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					E.
					<u>Ba.</u>
					803
				</span></i>
			; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἢν . . ἡ δ. ἐπανιστῆται</span>
			if <i>the slave-class</i> rise in rebellion, <i><span class="en">
				Th.
				5.23
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἡ Ἡρακλεωτῶν δ.</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Pl.
					<u>Lg.</u>
					776d
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὰς . . Εἱλωτείας καὶ Πενεστείας καὶ
					δουλείας</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Arist.
					<u>Pol.</u>
					1264a36
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>III.</b>
			<i>service for hire,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μισθὸν δουλείας</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					LXX
					<u>3 Ki.</u>
					5.6
				</span></i>
			.</div>
